---
slug: .well-known/oauth-authorization-server
method: get
format: json
---
{%- comment -%}
  RFC 8414 Authorization Server Metadata for the built-in AS. 404 when disabled (or
  when an external issuer is configured — then that issuer serves its own metadata).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  function cfg = 'modules/mcp/commands/config'
  function hdrs = 'modules/mcp/queries/oauth/endpoint_headers', cacheable: true
  response_headers hdrs
  if cfg.oauth.builtin
    function doc = 'modules/mcp/queries/oauth/server_metadata'
    response_status 200
    echo doc
  else
    response_status 404
    echo '{"error":"not_found"}'
  endif
-%}
